order_book_cli: 'valid/basic.csv' names no symbol, so it needs --symbol
usage: order_book_cli replay <path>... [--trades] [--events] [--book] [--validate none|final|per-command]
                                       [--symbol SYM] [--no-statistics]
       order_book_cli convert <path>... --out <path> [--symbol SYM]
       order_book_cli send <file> --connect ADDR:PORT [--symbol SYM]
       order_book_cli checkpoint describe|verify <file>
       order_book_cli demo
       order_book_cli --help
